@title  PCSA00029 - New Game: title screen, main menu, New Game, Start New Campaign, the Journal tutorial gate, the prologue's opening, the Jumping and Climbing tutorial, FIRST PLAYER CONTROL
@game   PCSA00029
@shot-every 1000

# WHAT THIS RECIPE PROVES
# ----------------------
# The title boots from its launcher into the game executable (LoadExec), reaches its title
# screen, starts a NEW GAME through the main menu and the "Start New Campaign?" prompt, passes
# the Journal tutorial on the loading overlay, and ends in the prologue under player control:
# the player character stands in the jungle ruins and walks when the stick is pushed. The
# prologue is a DEFERRED renderer - a G-buffer pass into an F32F32 target, HDR lighting into
# U2F10F10F10 with the G-buffer's depth carried across by the surface's FORCE_LOAD/STORE bits,
# a skinned character whose bone palette is read by index - so these shots are the check for
# all of that.
#
# EVERY INPUT IS A TOUCH OR THE STICK. The front end is touch-driven (panel coordinates are
# screen x2). Three things cost a session if they are not written down:
#  * The loading overlay's "Tutorial: Journal" is a TAP GATE: tap the journal icon, then the
#    page-curl icon; the CURL is what passes it.
#  * The prologue opens on a dark shot that WAITS FOR THE STICK - with no input it holds
#    there for ever, looking like a hang or a black-screen bug. Pushing forward starts play,
#    and the "Jumping and Climbing" tutorial panel comes up over it.
#  * That panel is dismissed with the same page-curl icon (1844,830).
# The load before gameplay ends anywhere in f7700..8500 between runs, so the stick is held
# from 8300 to 8700 and the panel is dismissed at 9000.

0: @section boot
1000: @shot title-screen
1300: touch=960,700
1308:
1600: @section new-game
1600: @shot main-menu
1600: touch=960,710
1608:
1900: touch=960,440
1908:
2300: @shot start-new-campaign
2300: touch=1250,874
2308:
5000: @section journal-gate
5000: @shot journal-gate
5000: touch=1756,380
5008:
5400: touch=1844,830
5408:
8300: @section prologue
8300: ly=0
8700:
8900: @shot tutorial-panel
9000: touch=1844,830
9008:
9100: @section player-control
9100: @shot player-control
9150: ly=0
9200: @shot walked
9230:
9300:
